{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18162","headline":"学诸进士作精卫衔石填海 · 韩愈","name":"学诸进士作精卫衔石填海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟有偿冤者，终年抱寸诚。\n口衔山石细，心望海波平。\n渺渺功难见，区区命已轻。\n人皆讥造次，我独赏专精。\n岂计休无日，惟应尽此生。\n何慙刺客传，不着报雠名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}